  etiket: dogc
  aciklama:
  - "1976 m\u0131? Vayy...\r\nO y\u0131l Apple Computer, Steve Jobs ve Steve Wozniak
    taraf\u0131ndan kurulmu\u015Ftu. Sen Apple'c\u0131 m\u0131s\u0131n Android'ci
    mi?"
  - "1976 m\u0131? Vayy...\r\n\u0130lk Ebola salg\u0131n\u0131 o y\u0131l Demokratik
    Kongo Cumhuriyeti s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131 i\xE7erisinde yer alan Yambuku kasabas\u0131nda
    ortaya \xE7\u0131km\u0131\u015Ft\u0131. \u0130yi ki oralarda do\u011Fmad\u0131n
    bak... "
